threads.body:
`describeBody` throws `NullPointerException` when `response.body()` is null.

```java
private static String describeBody(String body) {
  if (body == null) {
    return "null";
  }
  return body.length() <= MAX_BODY_DESCRIPTION_LENGTH
      ? body
      : body.substring(0, MAX_BODY_DESCRIPTION_LENGTH) + "...";
}
```

Similarly, `HttpClientWorkload.abbreviate` throws `NullPointerException` if `response.body()` is null.

